      "applicability": "Valid for the alternate interparticle friction mu_f=0.80 and for St in the range 0.01-300.",
      "statistical_basis": "Fit to simulation data; coefficients a_mu and alpha_mu from Table 1.",
      "uncertainty": "mu_c has uncertainty ±0.08; no uncertainty reported for a_mu or alpha_mu.",
